## Test Generation Best Practices

### 1. Coverage Goals - Aim for >80% code coverage - Test all public methods - Include edge cases and error paths

### 2. Test Organization - Group related tests in classes - Use descriptive test names - Follow AAA pattern (Arrange, Act, Assert)
